     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>關於3D繪圖 下面的函數想要建立一個概似函數 再跑出他的3D圖</div><div>但是發現 在</div><div>sum(y^2)+6*(b0^2)+(b1^2)*sum(x^2)+2*b0*b1*sum(x)-2*b0*sum(y)-2*b1*sum(x*y)是可以跑出3D圖的 但如果採用 矩陣的表示 t(y-b1*x-b0)%*%(y-b1*x-b0)</div><div>會出現長度不對的訊息 明明解都是一樣的 用 [1] 抓數字出來也不能跑 有高手可以幫解惑嗎?</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>read.table(&quot;D:/data3.txt&quot;)<br></div><div>data=read.table(&quot;D:/data3.txt&quot;)</div><div>x=data[,2]</div><div>y=data[,1]</div><div><br></div><div>b0=seq(-10,10,length=30)</div><div>b1=seq(17,19,length=30)</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>likelihood=function(b0,b1)</div><div>{</div><div> ((2*pi*16)^(-6/2))*exp(-((2*16)^(-1))*(sum(y^2)+6*(b0^2)+(b1^2)*sum(x^2)+2*b0*b1*sum(x)-2*b0*sum(y)-2*b1*sum(x*y)))</div><div><br></div><div>}</div><div><br></div><div>z=outer(b0,b1,likelihood)</div><div>persp(b0,b1,z, theta = 75, phi = 30, expand = 0.5, col = &quot;green&quot;,</div><div>ltheta = 90, shade = 0.75, ticktype = &quot;detailed&quot;,</div><div>xlab = &quot;b0&quot;, ylab = &quot;b1&quot;, zlab = &quot;Likelihood&quot;)</div><div><br></div><div>data3.txt 內容 <span style=\"color:rgb(62,69,76);font-family:Helvetica,Arial,&#39;lucida grande&#39;,tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif;line-height:16.6399993896484px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\">128.0    7.0</span></div><span style=\"color:rgb(62,69,76);font-family:Helvetica,Arial,&#39;lucida grande&#39;,tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif;line-height:16.6399993896484px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\">                        213.0   12.0</span><br style=\"color:rgb(62,69,76);font-family:Helvetica,Arial,&#39;lucida grande&#39;,tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif;line-height:16.6399993896484px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(62,69,76);font-family:Helvetica,Arial,&#39;lucida grande&#39;,tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif;line-height:16.6399993896484px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\">                        75.0    4.0</span><br style=\"color:rgb(62,69,76);font-family:Helvetica,Arial,&#39;lucida grande&#39;,tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif;line-height:16.6399993896484px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(62,69,76);font-family:Helvetica,Arial,&#39;lucida grande&#39;,tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif;line-height:16.6399993896484px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\">                        250.0   14.0</span><br style=\"color:rgb(62,69,76);font-family:Helvetica,Arial,&#39;lucida grande&#39;,tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif;line-height:16.6399993896484px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(62,69,76);font-family:Helvetica,Arial,&#39;lucida grande&#39;,tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif;line-height:16.6399993896484px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\">                        446.0   25.0</span><br style=\"color:rgb(62,69,76);font-family:Helvetica,Arial,&#39;lucida grande&#39;,tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif;line-height:16.6399993896484px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(62,69,76);font-family:Helvetica,Arial,&#39;lucida grande&#39;,tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif;line-height:16.6399993896484px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\">                        540.0   30.0</span></div>"
